<div class="tip"><b>Most common mistake:</b> keeping the English "there is … on the table" order, with the place at the end. <b>有一本书在桌子上。</b> is heard, but it sounds clumsy → <b>桌子上有一本书。</b> Place first, then <b>有</b>.</div>
